# GWI Pricing: Complete 2026 Breakdown

GWI (formerly GlobalWebIndex) is a consumer research and audience intelligence platform trusted by agencies, media owners, and brands globally. It surveys 1.4 million consumers annually across 50+ markets. Unlike most enterprise research tools, GWI offers a publicly disclosed pricing page with genuine self-serve tiers — an unusual transparency in the audience intelligence category.

## Pricing Model

GWI uses a **tiered subscription model** based on user count, data access depth, and platform features. Pricing is per-user-per-month for the self-serve Plus plan; Teams and Pro tiers involve custom annual contracts. Unlike ad tech DSPs, GWI does not charge a percentage of media spend.

Billing is available monthly or annually. Annual payment saves 15% on the Plus plan ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)).

## Pricing Tiers

The following is sourced directly from [GWI's published pricing page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing) and confirmed via [G2's GWI pricing overview](https://www.g2.com/products/gwi/pricing) (both verified April 2026):

| Plan | Monthly Price | Annual Price | Users |
|------|--------------|--------------|-------|
| **Free** | $0 | $0 | 1 |
| **Plus** | $150/user/month | $1,500/user/year | 1+ |
| **Teams** | Custom (contact sales) | Custom | Multiple |
| **Pro** | Custom (contact sales) | Custom | Multiple |
| **Enterprise** | Custom (contact sales) | Custom | Enterprise |

### Free Plan — $0

Available without a credit card. Includes ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)):
- 10 Agent Spark AI prompts per month
- Unlimited GWI Canvas decks (with watermark on exports)
- Access to 50,000 profiling points across global markets
- Chart generation (limited)

### Plus Plan — $150/user/month ($1,500/user/year)

Self-serve, purchasable directly on gwi.com with all major payment methods. Includes everything in Free, plus ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)):
- Unlimited Agent Spark prompts
- Save and export Canvas decks (no watermark)
- Previous quarter historical data
- Full chart data access

### Teams Plan — Custom Pricing

Contact sales for a quote. Adds ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)):
- View-only access to shared dashboards
- Saved audiences in Agent Spark prompts
- Multi-user volume discounts
- Up to 250,000 profiling points
- 4 quarters of historical data

### Pro Plan — Custom Pricing

Full platform access. Adds:
- Crosstabs and custom audiences
- 15+ years of trended data
- LLM-embedded Agent Spark (works within ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot)
- Up to 250,000 profiling points
- Option to add additional data sets (fees apply)

### Enterprise

Custom solutions with API access, dedicated account manager, expert support, and custom data integration. Contact GWI for pricing.

## Real-World Cost Benchmarks

Independent research provides some context for Teams and Pro contract sizes:

- A [Michael Brito industry report](https://www.britopian.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Top-10-Audience-Intelligence-Platforms.pdf) estimates full global agency access at **approximately $40,000/year**, noting significant variation based on scope (number of markets, number of users, data set breadth). This figure is described as a "rough ballpark" for full global access.
- [Guideflow's 2026 audience intelligence platform comparison](https://www.guideflow.com/blog/best-audience-intelligence-platforms) notes GWI as "custom" pricing with survey-based global panel data, consistent with the contact-sales model for Teams/Pro.
- The same Brito report characterizes GWI as "enterprise-priced (five figures annually)" for full access packages.

These third-party estimates should not be taken as quoted prices — actual pricing depends heavily on the number of users, markets accessed, and data modules included.

## Contract Minimums & Terms

- **Free plan**: No contract, no credit card required
- **Plus plan**: Monthly or annual. Annual saves 15%. Cancel anytime (per GWI's self-serve model)
- **Teams/Pro/Enterprise**: Annual contracts typical; contact GWI sales for minimums and terms
- **Payment currencies**: USD, GBP, EUR accepted ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing))
- **Sales tax**: All prices exclude local sales taxes ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing))
- **Free trial of Pro**: Available — contact GWI sales ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing))

