## How to Negotiate

1. **Start on Free, upgrade to Plus before your next media plan** — validate the data quality before committing to a custom enterprise contract
2. **For Teams/Pro, benchmark against Statista, YouGov, or Audiense** — these are GWI's closest competitors and can serve as pricing leverage in negotiations
3. **Ask about market-specific packages** — if you only need 2-3 markets, a scoped package will cost significantly less than full global access
4. **Request a Pro trial** — GWI offers this ([per their FAQ](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)) and it's the best way to evaluate whether the crosstabs and trended data justify the step-up from Plus
5. **Volume seat discounts** apply on Teams plans — larger teams should negotiate rates per seat rather than accepting a standard quote

