## Frequently Asked Questions

**Is GWI pricing public?**
Partially. The Free ($0) and Plus ($150/user/month) tiers are fully published on [gwi.com/pricing](https://www.gwi.com/pricing). Teams, Pro, and Enterprise tiers require a sales conversation.

**Can I start GWI for free?**
Yes. The Free plan requires no credit card and gives you 10 Agent Spark prompts per month plus unlimited Canvas decks. It's a genuine free tier, not a time-limited trial ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)).

**What is GWI's minimum annual contract?**
GWI does not publicly state a minimum. The Plus plan starts at $1,500/user/year. Custom Teams and Pro plans require direct engagement with sales — the estimated entry for agency-scale access ranges from $15,000–$40,000+/year based on third-party reports.

**How does GWI pricing compare to YouGov?**
Both are subscription-based consumer research platforms. GWI is more expensive at the enterprise level but includes broader global panel data (50+ markets, 1.4M annual interviews). YouGov offers lower entry points but more limited data depth in some markets. Direct comparison requires quotes from both.

**Does GWI charge per seat or per organization?**
The Plus plan is priced **per user per month**. Teams and Pro plans include multi-user discounts. Enterprise plans are organization-level with custom seat counts.

**Is a free trial available?**
Yes — GWI offers a Pro plan free trial upon request via their sales team ([GWI FAQ](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)). The Free plan is itself an ongoing no-cost option, not a trial.

**How do I buy GWI Plus?**
Self-service — purchase directly on gwi.com using a credit card in USD, GBP, or EUR. No sales call required for Plus ([GWI Pricing Page](https://www.gwi.com/pricing)).

**What is GWI's G2 rating?**
GWI holds a 4.5/5 rating from 183 reviews on G2, making it one of the highest-rated audience intelligence platforms ([G2 GWI Reviews](https://www.g2.com/products/gwi/reviews)).

